@startuml timing
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU
clock "Clock" as C with period 50
binary "Enabled" as EN

WB has Idle,Waiting,Processing
@0
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low

@100
WU is Waiting
WB is Processing
EN is high

@300
WB is Waiting
WU -> WB : URL

@450
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low
@enduml
